%% SD02 (as built, Stage 2) - F02 import project context, and F10 what changed.
%% Supersedes sd02-project-context.mmd, which is kept unchanged as the Stage 1 record.
%% The one difference: every available provider contributes to a single snapshot,
%% rather than the first available one winning and discarding the other's half.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Researcher
    participant GUI as MainGUI
    participant C as AppController
    participant A as ProjectContextAgent
    participant CC as ClaudeCodeContextProvider
    participant FB as FileBasedContextProvider
    participant M as ProjectMemory
    participant L as LLMClient

    Note over R,L: F02 - import project context
    R->>+GUI: picks a project directory
    GUI->>+C: importProjectContext(path)
    C->>+A: run(path)
    A->>A: availableProviders(path)

    Note over A,FB: every available provider contributes - they are<br/>complementary, not interchangeable
    opt coding-agent context present
        A->>+CC: scan(path)
        CC-->>-A: intent: what is in progress
    end
    opt directory is readable
        A->>+FB: scan(path)
        FB-->>-A: facts: commits, configs, result files
    end
    A->>A: merge into one ContextSnapshot
    break no provider could be read
        A-->>C: AgentException, nothing stored
    end

    A->>+L: generate(prompt with notable items)
    alt LLM unavailable
        L-->>A: ServiceError
        A-->>C: snapshot only, summary unavailable
    else summary returned
        L-->>A: readable summary
        A-->>C: snapshot + summary
    end
    deactivate L
    deactivate A
    C->>+M: saveSnapshot(s)
    M-->>-C: stored
    C-->>-GUI: imported facts + contributing providers
    GUI-->>-R: shows context, labelled by provider

    Note over R,L: F10 - project change summary, later
    R->>+GUI: opens "What changed"
    GUI->>+C: summarizeProjectChanges()
    C->>+M: getLastSnapshot()
    alt no prior snapshot
        M-->>C: empty snapshot
        C-->>GUI: prompt to import first
        GUI-->>R: "import your project first"
    else a snapshot exists
        M-->>-C: previous ContextSnapshot
        C->>+A: run(previous)
        A->>A: re-scan with the same providers
        A->>A: summarizeChanges(old, cur)
        A->>+L: generate(prompt with the diff)
        L-->>-A: natural-language summary
        A-->>-C: summary
        C->>M: saveSnapshot(cur)
        C-->>-GUI: summary
        GUI-->>-R: "What changed" panel
    end
